# Rapid Layers Store Links — environment variables
#
# This site does NOT need any secrets. Store names, URLs and logos are public
# information and live in src/data/stores.json (not here).
#
# If a future feature ever needs a secret (for example an API key), add the
# variable NAME below with a placeholder value, put the real value in
# .env.local (git-ignored) or in your hosting provider's secret settings,
# and only read it in server-side code — never in code that ships to the browser.
#
# Example (not used):
# SOME_API_KEY=replace-me
